* GENERIC FUNCTIONAL EQUIVALENT = 1N4148
* TYPE: DIODE
* SUBTYPE: SWITCHING
* THIS FILE CONTAINS 1 MODEL THAT CAN BE USED AS A TEMPERATURE TRACKING
